    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 268677,
        "name": {
          "full": "Rintarou Tsumugi",
          "native": "紬凛太郎",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b268677-APMPGH67QqPr.jpg"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 190 cm\n\nA student at Chidori High. Rintarou is a very kind and calm person, but his blonde hair and piercings—adopted due to struggles with self-expression in his childhood—have led to many writing him off as a delinquent. The exceptions to this are his close friends at Chidori High, as well as [Kaoruko](https://anilist.co/character/268676), a girl from an opposing school known as Kikyo Private Academy. After first meeting Kaoruko in his family's cake shop, Rintarou gradually begins to spend more time with her.\n\n~!Later, Rintarou falls for Kaoruko and confesses his feelings to her. While this causes some awkwardness between the two at first, she eventually returns his feelings and they begin dating.!~",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": "16"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 191121,
          "name": {
            "full": "Yoshinori Nakayama",
            "native": "中山祥徳"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n191121-DcWKbMDznWRQ.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "SUPPORTING",
      "node": {
        "id": 270095,
        "name": {
          "full": "Subaru Hoshina",
          "native": "保科昴",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b270095-Z5KpvacVXp1S.jpg"
        },
        "description": "[Kaoruko](https://anilist.co/character/268676/Kaoruko-Waguri)'s closest friend since middle school. Subaru is noted to be exceptionally pretty by her peers but has a somewhat withdrawn personality, particularly having trouble whilst talking to boys. She's also very protective of Kaoruko, initially disapproving of her relationship with [Rintaro](https://anilist.co/character/268677/Rintarou-Tsumugi) and the others before discovering how kindhearted the boys are.\n\n~!Despite becoming friendly with the Chidori High boys, Subaru feels as though she doesn't fit in with the group despite wanting to be close with them. However, with Kaoruko and the boys' help she reaffirms her friendship with them, even becoming comfortable enough to casually tease [Saku](https://anilist.co/character/272241/Saku-Natsusawa) and bring him presents for his birthday.!~",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "16"
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 152204,
          "name": {
            "full": "Aya Yamane",
            "native": "山根綺"
          },
          "image": {
